# Desktop option group: APPS — large GUI applications.
#
# Disable with `--build-arg APPS=0` (only relevant when DESKTOP=1). Every entry
# is a subset of omarchy/install/omarchy-base.packages; turning the group off
# removes these from the install set while keeping the rest of the desktop.

1password-beta
1password-cli
chromium
signal-desktop
spotify
obsidian
typora
libreoffice-fresh
obs-studio
kdenlive
pinta
xournalpp
localsend
evince
gnome-calculator
gnome-disk-utility
claude-code
